# `pluss::subsp::stats::ts::SsmForecastResult`

Result of `Ssm::forecast`.

`SsmForecastResult` is plain data; each field is a `Series`.

## Fields

| Field | Type | Default | Meaning |
|---|---|---|---|
| `observations` | `pluss::Series` | — | `H × n`: forecast observations. |
| `observations_cov` | `pluss::Series` | — | `H × n × n`: their covariance. |
| `states` | `pluss::Series` | — | `H × m`: forecast states. |
| `states_cov` | `pluss::Series` | — | `H × m × m`: their covariance. |

## Guidance

The defaults are a sensible starting point; change a field only for the reason its row gives.

